{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"19thシングル選抜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて二列目になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上小百合と共に福神になれたことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/05/8578966/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当ならもっと言いたいことあるはずなのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そればっかりになってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、応援してくださるみなさんへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありきたりですみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋に向けていろんな制作がんばってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/05/8578966/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日あさひなぐ完成披露試写会がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こざき先生にかけていただいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難い御言葉のおかげで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寿命が少し延びました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19thシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「いつかできるから今日できる」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の放送後、真っ先に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連絡くれたのが文乃！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー、うれしい、、ありがとうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月2日にEテレで放送された"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「テクネ〜映像の教室〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん見ましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『花枯去影』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間操作"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムラプス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステンドグラスのついたバス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"棘に囲われた右足"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤いスニーカーの左足"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生花のドレス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/05/8578966/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初、ドレスは重くてひとりで歩けないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間が経つに連れて何かから解かれるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体が軽くなっていくのを感じる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枯れていくことに対する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネガティブな感情は無くなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の背中を押してくれる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後押ししてくれる貴重な作品です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/05/8578966/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなのやりきった顔！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でしたああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督 柳沢さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影 岡村さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照明 上野さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術 栗林さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装 酒井さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽 戸波さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"編集 佐々木さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重力猫でお世話になったスタッフさん再び"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご一緒できてうれしかった、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制作陣のみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超タフで超かっこよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時間を乗り越えられたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対面白くなるって信じられたからだなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてチームの一員になれてた気がした、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枯れて身軽になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解放されてバスの外に出た瞬間、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ことばにできない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実感達成感に溢れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度も味わいたくなる感覚でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像って面白い、奥が深い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/09/05/8578966/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きだったモリゾーエリア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラの死角、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"座席に草が生い茂ってるみたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い違和感。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして実はこれ、ドレスの裾という、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真一枚だけで素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢があるよねえ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人の目に届いたら嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「花枯去影 DECAY / Dress woven by real flowers / 乃木坂46 伊藤万理華」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/vu7zwpYZin8"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中 anan/non-no/Ray/NYLON/装苑/StreetJack/Seventeen/日経エンタテイメント！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月6日 MdN/ダ・ヴィンチ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex